  "summary": "Malicious code in infogram-bot (PyPI)",
  "details": "The package provides Telegram-based remote access to the machine it runs on. It was deliberately created and used to hack other machines, exfiltrate files and credentials.\n\n\n---\n\nCategory: MALICIOUS - The campaign has clearly malicious intent, like infostealers.\n\n\nCampaign: 2026-08-httpz-requests\n\n\nReasons (based on the campaign):\n\n\n - files-exfiltration\n\n\n - rat\n\n\n - persistence\n\n\n - uses-telegram-bot\n\n\n - obfuscation\n\n\n - native-extension\n\n",
